{
  "message": "Your second-island and reef-damage devlog reports progress, but the linked media leave the playable slice unverified. The repository and playtesting article fulfil reference tasks, but halfway through, the goal remains at risk without a build or five-player findings. This gap is common and still fixable here: drop the trailer storyboard and fit the remaining build and tests into Alex’s 20–30 hours, without counting on Mia. I’ll meet you at the next sprint review and look forward to your build, test findings and devlogs ;).",
  "agreed": [
    {
      "text": "Spend at most 12 hours making two rough islands and a working tide loop. Share a playable build with controls.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Spend at most four hours testing the simplest two-player sailing setup in that build. Share the build if it works, or a short recording and blocker note if it does not.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Reserve four to six hours for five players to try the latest working build. Record what each completed, where they got stuck and whether they tested co-op. Publish the findings in a devlog linked to the build.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    }
  ]
}

